# Kiwi Sizing

> Kiwi Size Chart & Recommender is a Shopify app that adds customizable size charts and AI-powered size recommendations to product pages. More than 16,000 active shops use Kiwi to reduce size-related returns and increase conversions, and the app has over 500 five-star ratings on the Shopify App Store.

Kiwi offers a free plan, and all paid plans include a 14-day free trial. Merchants can build size charts for any product type (apparel, shoes, rings, hats, pet products, sporting goods), add a personalized size recommender, translate charts for international shoppers, and track sizing analytics.

